cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "DenCT — Dental CBCT & DICOM Viewer with Guided Implant Planning"
abstract: >-
  An open-source, embeddable dental CBCT / CT DICOM viewer and guided implant
  planner for React and TypeScript. It reconstructs a panoramic (OPG) view along
  the dental arch, renders the jaw in true 3D with linked MPR, plans implants
  with nerve, sinus and neighbour safety clearances, pairs intraoral surface
  scans to the volume by landmark or radiopaque-marker registration, and exports
  a 3D-printable surgical drill guide (STL) — entirely in the browser, with no
  upload of patient data. Research and demonstration software; not a certified
  medical device.
version: 1.4.0
date-released: 2026-10-18
url: "https://dental-cbct-viewer.vercel.app/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ZoliQua/Dental-CBCT-Viewer"
license: MIT
